			"notes": "- New \"Categories\" switch in the settings, \"Auto\" or \"Custom\":\n  - \"Auto\" sorts recipes into Blocks, Functional Blocks, Equipment & Utilities, Food & Drinks, Ingredients, and Redstone. You can reorder these categories\n  - \"Custom\" is the categories you set up yourself\n- The vanilla recipe book is always replaced, and the \"Disable vanilla recipe book\" setting is gone\n- The \"Debug\" button in the settings is now \"Recipes in current world\""
