			"notes": "Fixed bugs:\n- Ghost ingredients placed in the crafting grid now show tooltips on hover\n- Vanilla recipes always appear in the mod recipe book, even when the vanilla recipe book is enabled\n- On the first load, recipes already known in the vanilla recipe book are imported into the mod book\n- Changing \"Require all ingredients\" or \"Require a known crafting method\" rechecks already known recipes. On a remote server these two settings are locked to the server values\n- Search matches item ids. You can search by mod name with @\n- Having only the smithing table no longer unlocks every smithing recipe\n- Fixed crafting methods unlocking recipes for other methods\n- Fixed broken search in custom inventory screens from some mods"
		},
